# Source of truth

Authoritative documents:

- `AGENTS.md` — how the agent behaves
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — what Forge is
- `docs/ROADMAP.md` — which phase is current
- `docs/DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md` — how we write and ship code

If chat conflicts with these files, follow chat for this conversation only, then flag the conflict.

If `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, or `DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md` are empty or missing, do not invent their contents. Report the gap and wait.

Do not start Phase 0 or any other phase until the developer says `START PHASE N`. Cursor environment work is not that authorization.

Do not implement future-phase features, even if they look small. Design so evolution stays possible; do not build the future now.
